  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">U.S.-India Aviation Cooperation Program, Executive Development Training Program, through American Association of Airport Executives</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Executive Development Training Program (EDTP) will provide training to up to 25 Indian aviation representatives on technical, operational and managerial topics for aviation managers. The EDTP will consist of two training sessions in India and one Observation Visit in the United States. This training program supports the United States (U.S.)-India Aviation Cooperation Program (ACP), a public-private partnership aimed at increasing collaboration between the U.S. and Indian aviation sectors. This funding is being added to the U.S.-India Aviation Cooperation Program Executive Development Training Program.</narrative>
  </description>
